# Automated playtest bots — the part that genuinely runs for hours unattended
# and produces real numbers rather than impressions.
#
# Measures: win rate by build, time-to-death curves, weapons never picked,
# unwinnable seeds, difficulty spikes. Headless, seeded, reproducible.
#
# Portfolio convention applies: any statistic reported carries its uncertainty.
# A win rate from 12 runs is not a win rate.
